  "description": "The VoltBike Kodiak V2– an evolution of our popular Kodiak e-bike. It's got the same powerful 500W (750W Peak) motor, Torque Sensor, a 20 amp hour removable internal battery, and now comes with front suspension to make long rides more comfortable than ever.\nThe Kodiak V2 comes fitted with 20x4.25\" Kenda Kraze city tread tire, and can be fitted with optional rear passenger bars with padded seats for a premium passenger experience. A new front basket is also available, boosting cargo capacity even further.\nOur Kodiak is perfect for those looking to replace their cars with an eco-friendly, fun ride.\n*Please note that the rear basket and front basket are sold separately and are not included in the price. The rear child carrier is $200 and front rack is $80.",
